# sample-v1 is frozen

`sample-v1` is a read-only snapshot. Do not touch it.

- Never checkout `sample-v1` to do work
- Never commit, amend, rebase, merge into, or force-push `sample-v1`
- Never delete `sample-v1`
- New work goes on `main` only

If a task would change `sample-v1`, stop and stay on `main`.
